{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01XSuxnWNfyPgqB1ZLfgkXss", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.gotoknow.org/posts/598920\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/jmbr/article/download/271840/187924/1244842\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.thairath.co.th/lifestyle/life/967928\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.thairath.co.th/lifestyle/culture/2947731\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so06.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/Vanam_434/article/view/247603\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so06.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/husocjournal/article/download/295758/195156/1372564\"}, {\"url\": \"https://so02.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/clcjn/article/download/269594/180624/1134976\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.silpa-mag.com/culture/article_125717\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=125717\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T23:17:57.704Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "\"ผีเรือน\" หมายถึง ศัพท์โบราณ พจนานุกรม \"ผีเรือน\" คือ", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_019LwP4swqA7ga3uuiQ8ZJ7H", "content": [{"title": "จากผีโบราณสู่เรื่องเล่าแม่นาคพระโขนง : จากผีในจารึกสู่ผีภาพยนตร์", "url": "https://www.gotoknow.org/posts/598920"}, {"title": "so03.tci-thaijo.org", "url": "https://so03.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/jmbr/article/download/271840/187924/1244842"}, {"title": "www.thairath.co.th", "url": "https://www.thairath.co.th/lifestyle/life/967928"}, {"title": "www.thairath.co.th", "url": "https://www.thairath.co.th/lifestyle/culture/2947731"}, {"title": "คติความเชื่อเรื่องผีในยุควิทยาการสมัยใหม่ (IT)", "url": "https://so06.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/Vanam_434/article/view/247603"}, {"title": "so06.tci-thaijo.org", "url": "https://so06.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/husocjournal/article/download/295758/195156/1372564"}, {"title": "so02.tci-thaijo.org", "url": "https://so02.tci-thaijo.org/index.php/clcjn/article/download/269594/180624/1134976"}, {"title": "article 125717", "url": "https://www.silpa-mag.com/culture/article_125717"}, {"title": "www.silpa mag", "url": "https://www.silpa-mag.com/?p=125717"}]}, "I didn't find a direct dictionary entry for \"ผีเรือน\" in these results, so I can't confirm the official Royal Institute wording. The results do show how the term is used in context.\n\n- **Household spirit:** A Silpa Magazine article describes \"ผีเรือน\" as a spirit that watches over a family's descendants. It appears in the ผีกะ (ผีกละ) context, a northern Thai belief in a spirit that passes down through the mother's line and belongs to the \"ผีเมง\" family. ผีกะเป็นผีในตระกูล \"ผีเมง\" ผีเรือนที่คอยดูแลลูกหลานให้อยู่ดีมีสุข\n- **Neglect can bring harm:** The same article says that if owners neglect these spirits, the spirit may turn harmful to family members. หากเจ้าของไม่ยอมดูแลหรือให้ความสำคัญกับผี, the spirit may become angered and harm its descendants.\n- **Ritual usage:** A Thairath article refers to การแสดงความเคารพและ ไหว้ผีบ้านผีเรือน, meaning honoring the household spirits, typically during festivals such as Songkran or Sart.\n- **General \"ผี\" definition:** The Royal Institute dictionary, as quoted in a journal article, defines ผี broadly as something people believe is a mysterious presence that can appear to have a form and can bring benefit or harm. This is the general term, not the compound \"ผีเรือน\" specifically. (พจนานุกรมราชบัณฑิตยสถาน, 2554)\n\nFor an official dictionary definition, check the Royal Institute's online พจนานุกรม directly at the Royal Institute website, searching \"ผีเรือน\"."], "durationSeconds": 6.642829875000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01XSuxnWNfyPgqB1ZLfgkXss", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
